' timing: CommandScalePixel, CommandHideTimeAxis, CommandHighlight, CommandModeCompact, CommandFootboxIgnored
@startuml
mode compact
hide footbox
concise "C" as C
scale 100 as 50 pixels
scale 1 m as 20 pixels
hide time axis
manual time-axis
@0
C is a
@200
C is b
highlight 0 to 100 #Gold;line:DimGrey : setup
highlight 150 to 2147483647:0:0
@enduml
